OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrests as car
OL,4,A'driven at man'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 15-year-old boy and a 27-year-old man
OL,7,Fhave been arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fattempted murder after a teenager was
OL,9,Fleft with life-changing injuries when
OL,10,Fhe was hit by a car.
OL,12,FPolice were called to a disturbance in
OL,13,FBensham, Gateshead, at around 18:00 GMT
OL,14,Fon Tuesday. Minutes later, officers
OL,15,Freceived reports of a car being driven
OL,16,Fat a man on Dunsmuir Grove.
OL,18,FA 17-year-old and a 45-year-old have
OL,19,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of affray
OL,20,Fand section 18 assault.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
