OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrests as car
OL,4,A'driven at man'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Northumbria Police
OL,7,Fsaid: "Whilst enquiries are at an early
OL,8,Fstage, officers are treating the
OL,9,Freports of the disturbance and the
OL,10,Fsubsequent collision as linked." All
OL,11,Ffour have been released on bail.
